WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Standing light kick and standing jab start the cash-out.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.850
The first cancel Rush links standing jab to crouching heavy punch.

3
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.650
The second cancel Rush spends through the remaining Drive and enters burnout.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.150
Crouching heavy punch continues after the second Rush jab.

5
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.850
Medium Condor Wind links into Level 3.

6
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:09.150
Raging Typhoon begins after the Wind conversion.

7
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.800
The Level 3 finish leaves Ryu knocked down.
